title: "Sticky claims under lightweight post-training"
message: "If you use this software or these results, cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - name: fcavaletto
repository-code: "https://github.com/fcavaletto/false-belief-green-sky"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
abstract: >-
  A laptop-scale study of planting claims with LoRA on 4-bit Qwen3-14B,
  under a capability/recitation gate: verbal stickiness can rise while
  forced-choice use stays weak (saying ≠ using). The contested normative
  claim is a probe and is not endorsed.
